          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">恶魔？！它们怎么会出现在我们的世界中？
将虚空与现实分化开的结界在这里的确变弱了，
弱到能让恶魔们在幻影与真实之间切换状态…
到底为何？以前从没发生过这种事！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Daemons?! How can they materialize in our world? The fabric that separates this world from the ethereal realm is indeed thin here, but for a daemon to fully manifest itself -- why, it's unheard of!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这背后究竟是怎样一股黑暗力量在支撑？
真的都是#Boss_N07;干的吗？
我必须去调查清楚！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What dark powers are at work here? Could this really be the work of #Boss_N07;? I must investigate!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_bay1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊，你终于来了。前面就是束缚#Boss_N07;的地方。
但已经没有多余的空儿来缅怀过去，
更多恶魔正在实体化！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Ah, so you have finally arrived. Up ahead is where we once bound #Boss_N07; -- but this is no time for idle nostalgia! We have little time before more daemons materialize.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_bay2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">奇怪，好像有什么人接近了，
很可能是#Boss_N07;召来的帮手，我去拦截。
你来面对#Boss_N07;，并终结这一切！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I shall hold off anyone who attempts to stop you. You must confront #Boss_N07; -- and end this madness!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_bay3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">现在…再一次…冲嗡嗡嗡啊！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Now… Once again - GOOOO!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_bay4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是你！你果然是冒牌货！休想妨碍拯救世界的战斗！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Imposters! Didn't I take care of you once already?!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[P=1].[P=.5].[P=.5].[P=.5]所以，这就是那个话痨鬼的最后命令？
真是愚蠢啊，我都听着呢。至于我为什么在这…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">[P=1].[P=.5].[P=.5].[P=.5]So, the Order is here at last. Am I supposed to be impressed? Mindless drones. Do you even know why I am here?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这是因为我打破常规，努力寻找到那些失落的魔法，
其强大的力量已经远远超出我们的认知。
我的同仁们，不，应该是凡人们，颤抖吧！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It is because I saw beyond the walls of the castle, and journeyed far beyond the mortal realm, to seek knowledge long forgotten. My peers, if you will, grew afraid.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">所以他们想把我永远地困在这里，
只因为那些令人生厌的可悲规则。
最终，我将推翻它们，
然后按照我的意志重建这个世界！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">And so they bound me here, for what seems an eternity, and ultimately I turned down the path of hatred for the pathetic Order. Once I have disposed of it, I shall rebuild this world in my own image!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_intro4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">总而又言之，
你是个幸运的实验品，
能体验我精心设计的心灵决斗，
然后被击败地不折不扣！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">But first things first -- you are indeed a lucky victim, to be defeated purely through a MIND DUEL!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_mid</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你比我想象的更有力量…看来决定这场战斗胜负的，
不是我们心灵意志的强弱……而是对魔能的掌握！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You are more powerful than I anticipated. -- It seems that this battle will not be decided by the strength of our minds, but by our skill in spellcasting.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">今天就是你的2012！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Grimnir taunts the players during battle</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Your existence ends here.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你喊破喉咙吧没有人会来救你的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Star Trek Ref</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Resistance is futile.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">被我打出感觉来了吗？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Star Wars Ref</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Your feelings betray you.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你应该龟缩在巫师城堡里。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Grimnir taunts the players during battle</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You should have stayed in your castle.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight5</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你打起架来就像个挤奶的老农妇！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference to Monkey Island</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You fight like a dairy farmer!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_grimnir_fight6</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你以为你还有时间救自己吗。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference to "All your base"</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You have no chance to survive make your time.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_timeflux1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">追来的那些个冒牌货很强力！我拦不住…额
背后这巨大的身影是？！
糟糕，这场战斗我们无法胜出！
我必须使用…[P=2]那个魔法！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Standard anime way of expressing yourself… Raising the expectations of the "viewer" in a well, strange way.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This is a fight you can't win! I must use… THAT MAGICK!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW_Text_vlad_timeflux2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">波特传送！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Harry potter reference as vlad opens a gate to another dimension.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Portus!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们再次来到了这里，
不过这一次是要打败#Boss_N15;这个一直躲在暗处操纵的始作俑者！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">So, here we are once again -- but this time with the means to battle #Boss_N15; himself!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你必须在正确的时刻使用#magick_corporealize;魔法。
当机会来临时我会给你提示“信号”！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You must use #magick_corporealize; at just the right moment. I'll give you THE SIGNAL when the time comes!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">呃，我差点都忘了…因为一个美丽的误会，
你似乎好像大概…必须再跟过去的我打一次。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">He forgot that he fought the "imposter-wizards" last time they were at worlds end</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I forgot about that! Seems like you have to deal with me!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_grimnir_intro</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">……搞什么飞机？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What are you playing at?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_signal1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这就是“信号”！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This is the signal!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_signal2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">现在就用那个魔法！玻璃咿咿咿！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Do it now! Bleigh!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_signal3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我才不是羊癫疯发作！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"the signal" is just vlad shaking uncontrollably - could be misstaken for a seizure</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm not having a seizure!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Assatur_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]哈[P=.5]我终于可以实体化了！
原来是#Boss_N14;给了你把我拉进现实世界的力量吗？
真是一群头脑简单的家伙…
是你们亲手把你们可怜而渺小的世界推入虚空黑暗！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5]HA[P=.5] So #Boss_N14; has granted you the power to draw me into your world? Such simple minds. Little do you know the terrible fate you have consigned to your pitiful world.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Assatur_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">当我初次来到#Location_MidG;我就知道它必须被毁灭，
并被我的虚空领域所吞噬！
但我一直没能找到一个足够强大的
牺牲者来实现我的目的…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">When I first laid eyes on #Location_MidG; I knew that it needed to be destroyed, to be consumed by the ethereal realm -- but never did I find a victim powerful enough to do my bidding….</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Assatur_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">…直到我发现被千年枷锁困在#Location_EW;的#Boss_N07;，
他那满腔仇恨深深吸引了我。我告诉他，想要解脱，
就跟我一起联手报复世界吧！但是，现在，
你的出现，使得这个提线木偶…[P=3]已经没有用处了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">this line has been revised.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">...That is, until I found #Boss_N07; here, at #Location_EW;. He was already so full of hatred… Convincing him that destruction was the only way to end his misery -- why, nothing could be simpler. This puppet, however, has played out its role.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Assatur_intro4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">此时此刻…渺小的凡人，
我要向你展示#Location_MidG;是怎样一步一步被毁灭的，
就从你的脚下开始！！！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Now… Mortal -- I will show you how #Location_MidG; ends, starting with you!!!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Assatur_dead</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">什么？[P=1]不不不！[P=1]你不可能伤到我！！[P=2]
压了轴才出场那么点儿时间的Boss你伤[P=1]…不[P=1]…起！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Backstroke to the west reference</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What?[P=1] Noooo![P=1] This is improbable!!![P=2] DO[P=1] NOT[P=1] WANT!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_end1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">干得好！说句心里话，我没想到你真的打赢了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Well done! Honestly, I never actually thought you could do it! </Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_end2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">现在的我正在#Location_WC;，
也就是开"拯救世界"派对的地方。
只要用回城卷轴之类的传送魔法，
你就能立刻到达那里！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm back at #Location_WC; where we're just kicking off the "Saved-the-World Party". Just use the town-portal Magick, and you'll be back here in no time!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#EW2_Text_Fvlad_end3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">祝你 "好运"！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Good "Luck"!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
